    "long_instructions": "## Do This:\r\n\r\nYou want to create a custom function for your group chat that sends a string of your favorite emojis.\r\n\r\n1. Define a function called `emojis()`\r\n\r\n2. Inside your function, print a long string of emojis\r\n\r\n   For example: 🦄🌒🌼🦄🌒🌼🦄🌒🌼🦄🌒🌼\r\n\r\n\r\n3. Call your function\r\n\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n<i class=\"fa-solid fa-laptop\"></i> **Coding Tip**\r\n\r\nMake sure you use **parentheses** when calling your function, even if there are no inputs.",
